{"id":"cab6cce3f296","publishedAt":1794906019000,"posts":[[{"text":"(´・ω・｀)🍡"},{"text":"うめんだ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/POs1Zih.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/POs1Zih.jpeg"}],[{"text":"ゴマもうめんだ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/FWZc64z.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/FWZc64z.jpeg"}],[{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>3"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nこれうまそう"}],[{"text":"(´・ω・｀)"},{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>3"},{"text":"も遜色ないくらい美味かった"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nたしか箱根湯本"}],[{"text":"炭火焼きうめんだ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/79X3AmZ.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/79X3AmZ.jpeg"}],[{"text":"(´・ω・｀)沢山食べたけど"},{"br":1},{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>4"},{"text":"が団子にハマるきっかけになるくらい美味かった"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nひたち海浜公園の出店"}],[{"text":"(´・ω・｀)すまん醤油じゃないとダメだ"}],[{"text":"レジ横のもうめんだ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/83DkHXz.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/83DkHXz.jpeg"}],[{"text":"3色は？😠"}],[{"size":24,"text":"北海道 うめんだ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/j7XirRp.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/j7XirRp.jpeg"}],[{"text":"(´・ω・｀)"},{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>8"},{"text":"これは1粒1粒小さくて爪楊枝で刺して食べる団子"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n文字通り手が止まらない団子だったぜ"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nゴールデンカムイの子の団子だ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/HelBaXS.jpeg"}],[{"text":"醤油のは美味いけど甘いのは苦手"}],[{"text":"これも北海道"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/cuZrxP4.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/cuZrxP4.jpeg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/zAgoQzX.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/zAgoQzX.jpeg"}],[{"text":"どこか忘れた"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/skHhpvd.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/skHhpvd.jpeg"}],[{"text":"香川"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/WlNtCUw.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/WlNtCUw.jpeg"}],[{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>13"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nおいりかと思ったら"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n後ろのがおいりだった"}],[{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>32"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n(´・ω・｀)しあわせあんみつってやつ"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n横の建物にキリンがいて意味不明だった"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/f3VouRu.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/f3VouRu.jpeg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/4HGNb0B.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/4HGNb0B.jpeg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/duDkK1K.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/duDkK1K.jpeg"}],[{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>40"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n調べてみた"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n坂出市の清水屋と弥蘇場地藏堂か、キリンはけっこう有名なのか"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nあられみたいな「おいり」はソフトクリームのトッピングになったり、結婚式の引き出物になったりもするんよ"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n実家がとなりの愛媛だから、お裾分けで貰ったりもしてた"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nあと香川と言えば「しまひでえびせんべ～♪」と栗まんと灸まんと名物かまど、団子はあんまり聞いたことないなあ"}],[{"text":"じいちゃんと行った旅行で食った"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/gQWhzA1.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/gQWhzA1.jpeg"}],[{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>14"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n五平餅やな"}],[{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>44"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n(´・ω・｀)これ五平餅か！"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nじゃーじいちゃんとの旅行じゃねーやｗｗｗ"}],[{"text":"外で食う団子もうめんだ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/hLxa2fT.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/hLxa2fT.jpeg"}],[{"text":"うまそう"}],[{"text":"みたらしは甘すぎて苦手"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n磯辺揚げとか焦げた醤油味の団子が好き"}],[{"text":"(´・ω・｀)おまえらの団子コレクションも見せてくれ"}],[{"text":"（＾ω＾ ≡ ＾ω＾）おっおっおっ"}],[{"color":"#0000ff","text":"北海道年明けに"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://gbztoday.com/wp-content/uploads/image202608/bd95f68aa2d6_123B5/pbFtL0O.jpg"}],[{"img":"https://i.imgur.com/pbFtL0O.jpg"}],[{"color":"mediumblue","text":">>26"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n(´・ω・｀)おいこら 「団子」 は守れよ"}]],"comments":[]}